-- mxsab hub for Steal a Brainrot (Ultimate Fixed Version)
-- Based on researched mechanics: Remotes in ReplicatedStorage.Remotes, Steal:FireServer(brainrotObj)
-- Brainrots and Bases in Workspace with Owner.Value
-- Instant Steal: Teleport to enemy brainrot, steal, teleport to own base for auto-deposit (assuming proximity deposits)
-- Anti-Hit: Restore health, dampen velocity to prevent bounce
-- Invisible: Full transparency on descendants, including decals and accessories
-- No Clip: CanCollide false, with raycast to prevent floor fall-through by zeroing Y velocity when near ground
-- Fly: Smooth with unit vector and damping

